  "label": "Siamese Twin Metaphor",
  "description": "The use of the Siamese twin metaphor is a grotesque and dehumanizing way to describe a person's situation, implying physical and social abnormality. This metaphor is used to mock the person's bad day by linking it to a physically abnormal condition, which is a form of body-shaming and ableism.",
